{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Shawn Peterson","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-06-30T18:12:29.052Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Branded Sell Sheets for Private Label Brands | DaVinci Private Label","id":"216194811689","language":"en","layoutSections":{},"metaDescription":"Professional sell sheets for retail and wholesale channels. Template-based or fully custom. Print-ready PDFs ready to use at trade shows and pitches.","name":"Private Label - Page - Sell Sheets","pageRedirected":false,"publicAccessRules":[],"publicAccessRulesEnabled":false,"publishDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","published":false,"slug":"pl-demo-sell-sheets","state":"DRAFT","subcategory":"site_page","templatePath":"Private Label/Templates/Page.html","translations":{},"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T19:42:22.493Z","updatedById":"26261533","url":"https://info.davincilabs.com/pl-demo-sell-sheets","useFeaturedImage":false,"widgetContainers":{"main_content":{"widgets":[{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">SALES TOOLS</p>\n    <h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Branded sell sheets for retail and wholesale channels.</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Professional product sell sheets that you can hand to retailers, distributors, and healthcare professionals. Branded with your logo, formatted to your spec.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Request a Sell Sheet</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608851,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">The selling tool brands use to close retail and wholesale deals.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">When you walk into a retailer, present at a trade show, or pitch a healthcare professional, you need a one-page document that summarizes your product line, key ingredients, dosing, claims, and how to order. A branded sell sheet does that.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">We provide pre-built sell sheet templates that you can customize with your brand identity, or work with our design team for fully custom sell sheets matched to your overall brand system.</p>\n</div>"},"id":216201608852,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M19.5 14.25v-2.63c0-3.07-2.13-5.78-5.13-6.4-.62-.13-1.24-.25-1.87-.34V3.75A.75.75 0 0 0 11.75 3h-1.5a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75v1.13c-.63.09-1.25.2-1.87.34-3 .62-5.13 3.33-5.13 6.4V20.25M16.5 18.75h-9a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-3.75c0-3 1.92-5.62 4.75-6.45M9.75 9h4.5\"/><path d=\"M3.75 21h16.5M9 12h6m-6 3h6\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Template-based sell sheets</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Pre-built one-page sell sheet templates customized with your branding. Fast turnaround, included with private label engagement.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.81 4.94 9 2.25l-.81 2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 3L2.5 8.75l2.69.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3 3l.81 2.69.81-2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3-3l2.69-.81-2.69-.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-3ZM18 7.5l-.51 1.71a3 3 0 0 1-2.03 2.03L13.75 11.75l1.71.51a3 3 0 0 1 2.03 2.03L18 16l.51-1.71a3 3 0 0 1 2.03-2.03L22.25 11.75l-1.71-.51a3 3 0 0 1-2.03-2.03L18 7.5ZM16.5 18.75 16.04 20l-.46 1.25-.46-1.25-.46-1.25.46-1.25.46 1.25Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Fully custom design</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Custom sell sheets designed by our team to match your overall brand identity. Premium positioning, slower turnaround.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M12 21a9 9 0 0 0 0-18m0 18a9 9 0 0 1 0-18m0 18c2.07 0 3.75-4.03 3.75-9S14.07 3 12 3m0 18c-2.07 0-3.75-4.03-3.75-9S9.93 3 12 3M3.6 9h16.8M3.6 15h16.8\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Multi-format delivery</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Print-ready PDFs, web-friendly PDFs, and editable source files. Use them across digital and print channels.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608853,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your private label supplement line?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation. We will walk through your audience, the right formulations for them, branding options, and the timeline.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608854,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950032304,"label":"PL - Global Guide Offer","module_id":218944099153,"order":4,"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608856,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What goes on a supplement sell sheet?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Product image, key claims, ingredient highlights, suggested retail pricing (MSRP), wholesale pricing, MOQ for retailers, and shelf-ready packaging info. Sell sheets are designed for buyers at retail accounts to evaluate whether to bring your product onto their shelves.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Are sell sheets included or separately priced?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Template-based sell sheets are included with most private label engagements. Fully custom sell sheets (matching your premium brand identity, multi-page collateral, trade show booth materials) are separately scoped based on your needs.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can sell sheets be customized per retail account?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. You can adapt sell sheets per account (different pricing, different positioning) once you have the template established. We provide editable source files for ongoing self-service updates, or we can produce per-account variants for major retailers.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What format do sell sheets come in?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Print-ready PDFs (high resolution for tradeshow printing) and lighter web PDFs for email pitches. You can use them digitally or print as needed. Standard one-page sell sheets work for most situations; some categories warrant longer collateral pieces.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Should I have a different sell sheet for each SKU or one combined?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Depends on your line. Tightly themed lines (a single brand with 3-5 connected SKUs) usually benefit from a combined sell sheet showing the system. Broader catalogs work better as per-SKU sheets so retailers can evaluate one product at a time. We help you think through this based on your target accounts.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608857,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950032787,"label":"PL - Global FDA Disclaimer","module_id":218942529652,"order":7,"type":"module"}]}},"widgets":{}}